<mxCell id="p_fallbacks" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#D97706;&quot;&gt;FALLBACK &amp;amp; ESCALATION PATHS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px;font-size:9px;color:#475569;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Confidence &amp;lt; 95%:&lt;/b&gt; Route to HITL Review Cockpit&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Malformed Document:&lt;/b&gt; Structured rejection notification&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Specialist Rejection:&lt;/b&gt; Flag for compliance audit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#FCD34D;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="185" width="270" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p_security" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#047857;&quot;&gt;SECURITY &amp;amp; COMPLIANCE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px;font-size:9px;color:#475569;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Encryption:&lt;/b&gt; Cloud KMS (CMEK) at rest &amp;amp; TLS 1.3&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Privacy:&lt;/b&gt; Inline DLP redaction of sensitive fields&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Compliance:&lt;/b&gt; HIPAA / SOC2 compliant bucket lock&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#6EE7B7;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="300" width="270" height="115" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p_steps" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#6D28D9;&quot;&gt;IDP EXECUTION FLOW (1-10)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px;font-size:8.5px;color:#475569;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;1. Document uploaded to GCS landing zone&lt;br/&gt;2. Document AI extracts OCR layout &amp;amp; table schema&lt;br/&gt;3. Extracted JSON verified against field models&lt;br/&gt;4. Gemini 2.5 Flash validates cross-field arithmetic&lt;br/&gt;5. Confidence &amp;gt;= 95% routes to Straight-Through Path&lt;br/&gt;6. Exceptions (&amp;lt;95%) route to HITL Review Cockpit&lt;br/&gt;7. Human specialist approves / edits corrections&lt;br/&gt;8. Clean verified records stored in BigQuery Lakehouse&lt;br/&gt;9. Automated invoice payments posted to SAP/Workday&lt;br/&gt;10. Corrections exported for continuous model retrain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAF5FF;strokeColor=#D8B4FE;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="425" width="270" height="335" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
